[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0209","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0527","title":"DCScripts DCForum 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"DCScripts DCForum 2000 及更早版本的用户注册功能存在权限提升漏洞。远程攻击者可在注册表单的姓氏字段中插入管道符（|）和换行符，导致系统在注册数据库中创建额外条目，从而获得管理员权限。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可完全控制目标论坛系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0527"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 DCForum 至 2000 之后的版本（官方补丁页面 http://www.dcscripts.com/dcforum/dcfNews/167.html 已失效，该产品已停止维护）。如无法升级，在注册表单处理逻辑中对姓氏字段做严格输入过滤，禁止管道符（|）和换行符（\\n）输入，并对所有用户输入进行转义处理后再写入数据库。建议迁移至仍在维护的论坛系统（如 phpBB 或 Discourse）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0122.html","http://www.dcscripts.com/dcforum/dcfNews/167.html","http://www.osvdb.org/480","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6538","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20849","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0527.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0527.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0527","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0527.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0527.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rr68-4frw-wr7p/GHSA-rr68-4frw-wr7p.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_800_900.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-140.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0207","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0526","title":"Sun Solaris mailtool 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 8 及更早版本中 mailtool 所调用的 Xview 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 OPENWINHOME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 mailtool 进程权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0526"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:28Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 官方补丁 108434-03 或更高版本（适用于 Solaris 8），该补丁修复了 Xview 库在处理 OPENWINHOME 环境变量时的缓冲区溢出问题。对于 Solaris 7 及更早版本，请安装对应补丁 108435-03。如无法立即打补丁，可通过限制本地用户登录、移除 mailtool 的 setuid 权限作为临时缓解措施。由于 Solaris 8 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Solaris 11 或受支持的替代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0258.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6626","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20885","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0526","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d99b1b66d0cac20b8bc92baa53c2887e8bf76b6d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qc5-86ww-mrvw/GHSA-7qc5-86ww-mrvw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0206","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0522","title":"GNU GnuPG 1.0.x 格式字符串漏洞","description":"GnuPG (Gnu Privacy Guard) 1.05 及更早版本存在格式化字符串漏洞，源于程序在处理加密文件中存储的原始文件名时，未对格式化字符串进行正确验证。攻击者可构造包含恶意格式化字符串（如 %n、%s 等格式说明符）的文件名，将其加密后诱导受害者解密，解密过程中格式化字符串被作为格式参数处理，导致栈内存被任意读写，进而实现任意代码执行或提权。该漏洞影响 GnuPG 1.05 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，只需诱导用户解密恶意加密文件即可触发漏洞，攻击成功可导致系统完全被攻破。Debian 等发行版已发布安全公告 DSA-061 提供修复补丁，建议升级至 GnuPG 1.06 或更高版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0522"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GnuPG 到 1.0.6 或更高版本（1.0.6 版本已修复此格式字符串漏洞）。通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install gnupg`，RedHat/CentOS 执行 `yum update gnupg`，或从官网 https://gnupg.org/download/ 下载最新版本编译安装。若暂时无法升级，请避免处理来源不可信的加密文件，并在防火墙层面限制非必要的网络服务暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000399","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/